{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NAMAKORIUM is a chaotic, cooperative multiplayer RTS for up to four players.<br>Command the &quot;sea cleaners&quot;\u2014Namakos (sea cucumbers) left behind by humanity\u2014and clean up the polluted oceans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/c015cd7c709039b957cb672d805cc085.poster.avif?t=1769070639\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/c015cd7c709039b957cb672d805cc085.webm?t=1769070639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/c015cd7c709039b957cb672d805cc085.mp4?t=1769070639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you reclaim the beautiful sea?<br>It\u2019s all up to your planning skills, your friends, and your trusty sea cucumbers.<br>Get ready for a frantic, action-packed ocean cleanup operation!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Organize Your Namako Operation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command unique Namakos, gather resources, construct buildings, and clear paths\u2014the tasks are many and time is short.<br>Purify all the pollution before the food runs out!<br>Will your strategy hold up under pressure and succeed with the team?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/d190327ffce1aad3c9d7d1127c8d5362.poster.avif?t=1769070639\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/d190327ffce1aad3c9d7d1127c8d5362.webm?t=1769070639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/d190327ffce1aad3c9d7d1127c8d5362.mp4?t=1769070639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Namakos with Special Traits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shell Namako gathers limestone. Iron Namako is great at mining. Flame Namako and Ice Namako can survive extreme temperatures.<br>Use their distinct abilities to assign roles and conquer each stage together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/397c5cde778c06561d615423330c3789.poster.avif?t=1769070639\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/397c5cde778c06561d615423330c3789.webm?t=1769070639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/397c5cde778c06561d615423330c3789.mp4?t=1769070639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restore the Ocean\u2019s Beauty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you decontaminate, corals bloom, sunlight shines through, and the ocean regains vibrant color.<br>Over 50 types of &quot;Scenic Creatures&quot; will begin to swim in\u2014try to collect them all as you heal the seas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/3545ce50fbdfb601445d7ed972708cbc.poster.avif?t=1769070639\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/3545ce50fbdfb601445d7ed972708cbc.webm?t=1769070639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/3545ce50fbdfb601445d7ed972708cbc.mp4?t=1769070639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beware the \u201cBlight Namako\u201d!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During cleanup, corrupted Namako known as &quot;Blight Namako&quot; may suddenly appear.<br>They rot your food and drag the ocean back into darkness.<br>Team up and repel them with the mighty Namako Fusion Cannon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/36d705b31ded4bba97a6d1eb19ca38c3.poster.avif?t=1769070639\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/36d705b31ded4bba97a6d1eb19ca38c3.webm?t=1769070639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/36d705b31ded4bba97a6d1eb19ca38c3.mp4?t=1769070639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planning x RTS Gameplay: Strategize based on map structure and control multiple cucumbers simultaneously</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic Cooperative Play: Plans may succeed... or hilariously fail\u2014every match brings its own story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op matches where you can easily team up and play with friends or strangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 Scenic Creatures: Discover real and fantasy species as you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Unique Stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage Titles Based on Clear Time</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable Sea Cucumbers &amp; a Hidden Post-Apocalyptic Worldview</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New stages, mechanics, and more will be added in future updates.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guidelines for Streaming and Video Posting</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and Video Posting: OK (Very welcome!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization: OK</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prohibited Streaming Areas: None</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you could include a link to your Steam store page in the description.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866920?t=1769070639","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/96f5de646844fbba1653ae40a434a082200f2273/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769070639","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/d172b1de950c768ec2c544e2e044ace53498b249/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769070639","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/d172b1de950c768ec2c544e2e044ace53498b249/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769070639","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NAMAKORIUM is a chaotic, cooperative multiplayer RTS for up to four players.<br>Command the &quot;sea cleaners&quot;\u2014Namakos (sea cucumbers) left behind by humanity\u2014and clean up the polluted oceans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/c015cd7c709039b957cb672d805cc085.poster.avif?t=1769070639\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/c015cd7c709039b957cb672d805cc085.webm?t=1769070639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/c015cd7c709039b957cb672d805cc085.mp4?t=1769070639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you reclaim the beautiful sea?<br>It\u2019s all up to your planning skills, your friends, and your trusty sea cucumbers.<br>Get ready for a frantic, action-packed ocean cleanup operation!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Organize Your Namako Operation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command unique Namakos, gather resources, construct buildings, and clear paths\u2014the tasks are many and time is short.<br>Purify all the pollution before the food runs out!<br>Will your strategy hold up under pressure and succeed with the team?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/d190327ffce1aad3c9d7d1127c8d5362.poster.avif?t=1769070639\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/d190327ffce1aad3c9d7d1127c8d5362.webm?t=1769070639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/d190327ffce1aad3c9d7d1127c8d5362.mp4?t=1769070639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Namakos with Special Traits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shell Namako gathers limestone. Iron Namako is great at mining. Flame Namako and Ice Namako can survive extreme temperatures.<br>Use their distinct abilities to assign roles and conquer each stage together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/397c5cde778c06561d615423330c3789.poster.avif?t=1769070639\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/397c5cde778c06561d615423330c3789.webm?t=1769070639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/397c5cde778c06561d615423330c3789.mp4?t=1769070639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restore the Ocean\u2019s Beauty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you decontaminate, corals bloom, sunlight shines through, and the ocean regains vibrant color.<br>Over 50 types of &quot;Scenic Creatures&quot; will begin to swim in\u2014try to collect them all as you heal the seas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/3545ce50fbdfb601445d7ed972708cbc.poster.avif?t=1769070639\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/3545ce50fbdfb601445d7ed972708cbc.webm?t=1769070639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/3545ce50fbdfb601445d7ed972708cbc.mp4?t=1769070639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beware the \u201cBlight Namako\u201d!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During cleanup, corrupted Namako known as &quot;Blight Namako&quot; may suddenly appear.<br>They rot your food and drag the ocean back into darkness.<br>Team up and repel them with the mighty Namako Fusion Cannon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/36d705b31ded4bba97a6d1eb19ca38c3.poster.avif?t=1769070639\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/36d705b31ded4bba97a6d1eb19ca38c3.webm?t=1769070639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/36d705b31ded4bba97a6d1eb19ca38c3.mp4?t=1769070639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planning x RTS Gameplay: Strategize based on map structure and control multiple cucumbers simultaneously</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic Cooperative Play: Plans may succeed... or hilariously fail\u2014every match brings its own story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op matches where you can easily team up and play with friends or strangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 Scenic Creatures: Discover real and fantasy species as you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Unique Stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage Titles Based on Clear Time</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable Sea Cucumbers &amp; a Hidden Post-Apocalyptic Worldview</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New stages, mechanics, and more will be added in future updates.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guidelines for Streaming and Video Posting</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and Video Posting: OK (Very welcome!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization: OK</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prohibited Streaming Areas: None</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you could include a link to your Steam store page in the description.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Polyscape Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/21ea604d38cb9d0577399f21637f6be1b653212d/header.jpg?t=1769070639","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3866920/904544727/4c2a1554071ebc65cc83d9442e7ab2137f1e2268/1755002654/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756079570","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3866920/904544727/4c2a1554071ebc65cc83d9442e7ab2137f1e2268/1755002654/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756079570","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3866920/904544727/4c2a1554071ebc65cc83d9442e7ab2137f1e2268/1755002654/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756079570","id":257182051,"name":"Reveal Trailer English","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257182051/d1165d38e1f50607acc4ce534963252f608e4ba4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756079570"}],"name":"NAMAKORIUM (\u30ca\u30de\u30b3\u30ea\u30a6\u30e0)","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later (64-Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-3570K 3.4 GHz 4 Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050 (2GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Internet connection required for multiplayer. SSD required.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later (64-Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i9-9900K 3.6 GHz 8 Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 2070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Internet connection required for multiplayer. SSD required.</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Polyscape Inc."],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"29 Jan, 2026"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/cd4dd4dbb3b38a81e51b78db712a721350102790/ss_cd4dd4dbb3b38a81e51b78db712a721350102790.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769070639","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/cd4dd4dbb3b38a81e51b78db712a721350102790/ss_cd4dd4dbb3b38a81e51b78db712a721350102790.600x338.jpg?t=1769070639"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/18c82beb2b03f8c7a44ea0ae5dd1f4d8321bf863/ss_18c82beb2b03f8c7a44ea0ae5dd1f4d8321bf863.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769070639","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/18c82beb2b03f8c7a44ea0ae5dd1f4d8321bf863/ss_18c82beb2b03f8c7a44ea0ae5dd1f4d8321bf863.600x338.jpg?t=1769070639"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/34a349de529d97ad029207d78c4e68d671344e68/ss_34a349de529d97ad029207d78c4e68d671344e68.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769070639","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/34a349de529d97ad029207d78c4e68d671344e68/ss_34a349de529d97ad029207d78c4e68d671344e68.600x338.jpg?t=1769070639"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/a2e53f4c0ab1b91e625ebe8fbc3a2aacb1d56fda/ss_a2e53f4c0ab1b91e625ebe8fbc3a2aacb1d56fda.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769070639","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/a2e53f4c0ab1b91e625ebe8fbc3a2aacb1d56fda/ss_a2e53f4c0ab1b91e625ebe8fbc3a2aacb1d56fda.600x338.jpg?t=1769070639"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/0c93bd58c5198d863f7211e799534c6cd8bc5218/ss_0c93bd58c5198d863f7211e799534c6cd8bc5218.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769070639","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/0c93bd58c5198d863f7211e799534c6cd8bc5218/ss_0c93bd58c5198d863f7211e799534c6cd8bc5218.600x338.jpg?t=1769070639"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/dfc02538b41d3b8593bc847cbf7ed6d85e99ad0f/ss_dfc02538b41d3b8593bc847cbf7ed6d85e99ad0f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769070639","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/dfc02538b41d3b8593bc847cbf7ed6d85e99ad0f/ss_dfc02538b41d3b8593bc847cbf7ed6d85e99ad0f.600x338.jpg?t=1769070639"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/8115e43c949301830789b777ce7192d4b0099c7c/ss_8115e43c949301830789b777ce7192d4b0099c7c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769070639","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/8115e43c949301830789b777ce7192d4b0099c7c/ss_8115e43c949301830789b777ce7192d4b0099c7c.600x338.jpg?t=1769070639"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/2b4a20f7daedc746d762910771eac6728ffe7d2b/ss_2b4a20f7daedc746d762910771eac6728ffe7d2b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769070639","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/2b4a20f7daedc746d762910771eac6728ffe7d2b/ss_2b4a20f7daedc746d762910771eac6728ffe7d2b.600x338.jpg?t=1769070639"}],"short_description":"Namako (Sea cucumbers) will save the Earth\u2014NAMAKORIUM is a chaotic, cooperative multiplayer RTS game for up to four players. Command the \u201ccleaners of the sea\u201d \u2014Namako left behind by humanity and work together to clean up the polluted oceans!","steam_appid":3866920,"support_info":{"email":"info@polyscape.io","url":"https://polyscape.io/contact"},"supported_languages":"English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean","type":"game","website":null}